---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="公民科技專案地圖 - 台灣教育處方籤"
  description="彙整 8 個台灣公民科技專案與 108 課綱核心素養及 SDGs 的對照應用，並整理 g0v Summit、零時小學校、SITCON 等社群活動參與管道，為高中生自主學習與探究實作提供靈感。"
  currentSection="civic-tech-map"
  bodyClass="bg-gray-100 text-gray-800"
  isSectionIndex
>
    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main id="main-content" class="container mx-auto px-6 py-12">

        <!-- Page Hero Section -->
        <section class="text-center mb-16">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4">
                公民科技專案<span class="gradient-text">地圖</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
                源自 SITCON 2025「零時小學校」共創工作坊。彙整 8 個台灣公民科技專案（多數源自 g0v 零時政府社群），對應 108 課綱核心素養與 SDGs；並整理 g0v Summit、零時小學校、SITCON 等社群活動，為你的自主學習與探究實作提供靈感與實際參與管道。
            </p>
        </section>

        <!-- AI Exploration Suggester -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-16" aria-label="AI 探索建議器">
            <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
                <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2 text-center">找到你的公民科技切入點</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-center mb-6">
                    輸入你的興趣或關心的議題，AI 將為你推薦最適合的公民科技專案與探索方向。
                </p>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <label for="ai-interest-input" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">你的興趣或關心的議題</label>
                    <textarea
                        id="ai-interest-input"
                        rows="3"
                        maxlength="300"
                        class="w-full border-2 border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-4 text-gray-800 placeholder-gray-400 focus:border-emerald-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-200 transition resize-none"
                        placeholder="例如：我對環境保護很有興趣，想了解如何用科技改善環境問題..."
                    ></textarea>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                        <span id="ai-char-count" class="text-xs text-gray-400">0 / 300</span>
                        <button
                            id="ai-submit-btn"
                            type="button"
                            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold py-2.5 px-6 rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-700 transition duration-300 disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
                        >
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
                            探索推薦
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- AI Results Area -->
                <div id="ai-results" class="mt-6 hidden" aria-live="polite">
                    <!-- Loading state -->
                    <div id="ai-loading" class="hidden text-center py-8">
                        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 text-emerald-700">
                            <svg class="animate-spin h-5 w-5" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                <circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle>
                                <path class="opacity-75" fill="currentColor" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4z"></path>
                            </svg>
                            <span class="font-medium">AI 正在分析你的興趣...</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Result content -->
                    <div id="ai-result-content" class="hidden">
                        <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-lg p-6">
                            <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-800 mb-3">AI 推薦結果</h3>
                            <div id="ai-result-text" class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line"></div>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-3 text-center">
                            AI 建議僅供參考，實際專案內容請以各專案官網為準。
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Error state -->
                    <div id="ai-error" class="hidden">
                        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4 text-center">
                            <p id="ai-error-text" class="text-sm text-red-700"></p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Why Section -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-16" aria-label="為什麼要看這份對照表">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">為什麼要看這份對照表？</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">在「探究與實作」或「自主學習」課程中，你可能苦惱於找不到與真實世界連結的題目。公民科技專案處理的是真實存在的社會問題，參與它們不僅能解決問題，更能直接鍛鍊課綱強調的素養能力。</p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
                <div class="why-card bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-lg p-5">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="flex items-center justify-center h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-amber-100" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-amber-800">尋找題目靈感</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-amber-700">從環保、假訊息、語言保存等真實社會議題出發，發展你的研究計畫。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200 rounded-lg p-5">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="flex items-center justify-center h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-sky-100" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-sky-800">素養具象化</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-sky-700">了解「系統思考」或「公民意識」在實際專案中長什麼樣子，不再只是抽象名詞。</p>
                </div>
                <div class="why-card bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-lg p-5">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                        <span class="flex items-center justify-center h-10 w-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-100" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3.055 11H5a2 2 0 012 2v1a2 2 0 002 2 2 2 0 012 2v2.945M8 3.935V5.5A2.5 2.5 0 0010.5 8h.5a2 2 0 012 2 2 2 0 104 0 2 2 0 012-2h1.064M15 20.488V18a2 2 0 012-2h3.064M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-emerald-800">接軌國際</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-emerald-700">許多專案與聯合國 SDGs 直接相關，豐富你的學習歷程檔案，展現國際視野。</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Tag Legend -->
        <section class="mb-4" aria-label="標籤說明">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 justify-center">
                <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500">標籤說明：</span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 border border-amber-200">
                    <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.394 2.08a1 1 0 00-.788 0l-7 3a1 1 0 000 1.84L5.25 8.051a.999.999 0 01.356-.257l4-1.714a1 1 0 11.788 1.838l-3.488 1.495L10 12.568l6.61-2.831a1 1 0 000-1.84l-7-3z"></path><path d="M3.31 9.397L5 10.12v4.102a8.969 8.969 0 00-1.05-.174 1 1 0 01-.89-.89 11.115 11.115 0 01.25-3.762zm5.99 7.176A9.026 9.026 0 007 15.68a1 1 0 01-.19-1.34l.99-1.49A8.962 8.962 0 009.3 16.573z"></path></svg>
                    學科領域
                </span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-800 border border-sky-200">
                    <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M6.267 3.455a3.066 3.066 0 001.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 013.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 001.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 012.812 2.812c.051.643.304 1.254.723 1.745a3.066 3.066 0 010 3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723 1.745 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812 2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-3.976 0 3.066 3.066 0 00-1.745-.723 3.066 3.066 0 01-2.812-2.812 3.066 3.066 0 00-.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 010-3.976 3.066 3.066 0 00.723-1.745 3.066 3.066 0 012.812-2.812zm7.44 5.252a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
                    核心素養
                </span>
                <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 border border-emerald-200">
                    <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM4.332 8.027a6.012 6.012 0 011.912-2.706C6.512 5.73 6.974 6 7.5 6A1.5 1.5 0 019 7.5V8a2 2 0 004 0 2 2 0 011.523-1.943A5.977 5.977 0 0116 10c0 .34-.028.675-.083 1H15a2 2 0 00-2 2v2.197A5.973 5.973 0 0110 16v-2a2 2 0 00-2-2 2 2 0 01-2-2 2 2 0 00-1.668-1.973z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg>
                    SDGs
                </span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Quick Navigation (sticky) + Expand/Collapse Controls -->
        <nav class="sticky top-[68px] z-40 bg-gray-100/80 backdrop-blur-sm py-3 mb-8" aria-label="專案快速導航">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                <!-- Project links (scrollable) -->
                <div class="flex-1 overflow-x-auto scrollbar-hide">
                    <div class="flex gap-2 min-w-max px-1">
                        <a href="#disfactory" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-emerald-100 hover:text-emerald-800 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap">Disfactory</a>
                        <a href="#cofacts" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-sky-100 hover:text-sky-800 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap">Cofacts</a>
                        <a href="#amis-moedict" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-violet-100 hover:text-violet-800 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap">阿美語萌典</a>
                        <a href="#thaubing" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-lime-100 hover:text-lime-800 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap">透明足跡</a>
                        <a href="#lawtrace" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-indigo-100 hover:text-indigo-800 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap">立法足跡</a>
                        <a href="#vtaiwan" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-cyan-100 hover:text-cyan-800 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap">vTaiwan</a>
                        <a href="#civil-iot" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-orange-100 hover:text-orange-800 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap">民生公共物聯網</a>
                        <a href="#national-treasure" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-700 hover:bg-rose-100 hover:text-rose-800 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap">國家寶藏</a>
                        <a href="#join-community" class="text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap">參與社群</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Expand/Collapse controls -->
                <div class="flex-shrink-0 flex gap-1">
                    <button id="expand-all-btn" type="button" class="text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-200 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap" aria-label="展開全部詳情">
                        展開全部
                    </button>
                    <button id="collapse-all-btn" type="button" class="text-xs font-medium px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-200 transition shadow-sm whitespace-nowrap" aria-label="收合全部詳情">
                        收合全部
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <!-- Project Cards -->
        <section id="project-list" class="space-y-8" aria-label="公民科技專案列表">

            <!-- Project 1: Disfactory -->
            <article class="project-card bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden scroll-mt-36" id="disfactory">
                <div class="border-l-4 border-emerald-500 p-6 md:p-8">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Disfactory 農地違章工廠回報系統</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">地球公民基金會 × g0v 社群共同開發</p>
                        </div>
                        <a href="https://disfactory.tw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-emerald-600 text-white font-bold py-2 px-5 rounded-lg hover:bg-emerald-700 transition duration-300 text-sm self-start">
                            前往專案
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tag-container flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800">地理 (GIS)</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800">公民與社會</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-800">A2 系統思考與解決問題</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-800">C1 道德實踐與公民意識</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">SDG 11 永續城鄉</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">SDG 15 陸域生態</span>
                        <button type="button" class="tag-more-btn hidden text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-200 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-300 transition" aria-label="顯示更多標籤"></button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">利用衛星圖資與群眾外包（Crowdsourcing），標記台灣農地上新增的違章工廠，協助政府執法並保護農地與糧食安全。專案已從志工專案轉由地球公民基金會接手長期營運，並陸續發展出衛星影像辨識遊戲「大家來找廠」，以及追蹤工廠登記與拆除狀態的 license.disfactory.tw。專案開源授權 MIT License，資料採 CC BY 4.0，至今 GitHub 倉庫仍持續維護。</p>
                    <div class="mt-5">
                        <button type="button" class="details-toggle flex items-center gap-2 text-emerald-700 font-semibold text-sm hover:text-emerald-800 transition" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="details-disfactory" onclick="toggleDetails(this)">
                            <svg class="w-5 h-5 chevron" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
                            自主學習執行靈感
                        </button>
                        <div id="details-disfactory" role="region" aria-labelledby="disfactory" class="details-content mt-3">
                            <div class="bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 rounded-lg p-5 space-y-3">
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-700"><strong class="text-emerald-800">探究方向：</strong>利用政府開放資料（Open Data）分析你居住縣市的農地流失狀況，探討土地使用分區管制與實際現況的落差。</p>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-700"><strong class="text-emerald-800">實作產出：</strong>參與配套遊戲「大家來找廠」辨識衛星圖中的建物並標記資料，撰寫關於國土規劃政策的研究報告。</p>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-700"><strong class="text-emerald-800">延伸資源：</strong>
                                    <a href="https://spot.disfactory.tw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700 underline">大家來找廠（spot.disfactory.tw）</a>
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </article>

            <!-- Project 2: Cofacts -->
            <article class="project-card bg-white rounded-xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden scroll-mt-36" id="cofacts">
                <div class="border-l-4 border-sky-500 p-6 md:p-8">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">Cofacts 真的假的</h3>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">g0v 社群協作專案</p>
                        </div>
                        <a href="https://cofacts.tw/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex-shrink-0 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-sky-600 text-white font-bold py-2 px-5 rounded-lg hover:bg-sky-700 transition duration-300 text-sm self-start">
                            前往專案
                            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tag-container flex flex-wrap gap-2 mb-4">
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800">資訊科技</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-800">公民與社會 (媒體識讀)</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-800">B2 科技資訊與媒體素養</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-100 text-sky-800">A1 身心素質與自我精進</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">SDG 4 優質教育</span>
                        <span class="project-tag text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800">SDG 16 和平正義與有力的制度</span>
                        <button type="button" class="tag-more-btn hidden text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-gray-200 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-300 transition" aria-label="顯示更多標籤"></button>
                    </div>
